  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      273.53,
      526.04,
      319.25
    ],
    "text": "A low-pressure area is likely to form over Southeast and adjoining East-central Bay of Bengal around 23rd October, 2026. Then it is likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify further.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      338.09,
      526.12,
      383.69
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-20N and 80E-95E. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
